SUMMARY:THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating and Modern R
 elationships
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n(Free Online E
 vent)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\n**The Challenges of Modern
  Dating and Modern Relationships** is a one-hour interactive Zoom discussi
 on hosted and moderated by **Steve Flemming** through the **Soul City Soci
 al Club**. Together we'll explore the realities of dating and relationship
 s in today's fast-changing world—communication\, trust\, expectations\, 
 loneliness\, technology\, emotional connection\, and what it really takes 
 to build healthy\, lasting relationships. Whether you're single\, dating\,
  married\, separated\, or simply interested in understanding the modern re
 lationship landscape\, you're welcome to join this respectful\, open-minde
 d conversation. Come to share your experiences\, listen to others\, and le
 ave with fresh perspectives in a friendly\, supportive\, and judgment-free
  environment.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us between 8:00 pm and 8:10
  pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away :)\n\n***\n\nCamera's
  On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\nSoul City Social Club\nhttps://
 www.meetup.com/soulcity/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs/vide
 os\n\n\\*If you do wish to support and contribute to this and these Thursd
 ay Night online events that include 3 plus hours of music after\; you can 
 do so through e transfer or pay pal to steveflemming11@gmail.com\nYou're s
 upport and gratitude is greatly appreciated!\n\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us
 04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after the event for Stev
 e Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart**\nCanadian Folk and Country Artist\
 nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/315427766/
