SUMMARY:The Friday Night Ultimate Pub Crawl! (Live Band\, DJ and Dancing) 
 (Ladies Night!)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n**Kindly Read 
 Carefully:**\n\nWanna make some new friends in the best part of town?\n\nL
 et's start our weekend off right with a fun night out\, with good times\, 
 conversations and a couple cool venues with Live Music\, DJ and Dancing. (
 Possibly a 3rd venue)\n\nFirst we will meet at ***(La Carnita - (main floo
 r to find us)*** to get our evening going. (Conveniently located at Yonge 
 & Eglinton\; 3-4 minute walk east on Eglinton.\n\nThe next venue is only a
  few minutes away from there (our Secret Location- with a live band and da
 ncing!)\n\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**La Carnita - Good Fortune Bar-** You w
 ill be directed downstairs to there cool party room area :)\n**Date:** Fri
 day July 10th\, 2026\n**Address:** 130 Eglinton Ave. Toronto\, ON M4P 2X9\
 n**Arrive between:** 8:00 pm and 10:00 pm (save a little money if you come
  before 9:00 pm-plus more time to meet everyone :)\n**Ladies Night!** (Red
 uced event fee for the Ladies tonight)\n\n**Highlights:**\n\\*Reserved tab
 les and seating for dinner\, cocktails and mingling\n\\*Venue is very clos
 e to the Yonge and Eglinton subway station\n\\*Ice breaker game to make it
  easy to meet and connect with everyone :)\n\\*A fun game to win complimen
 tary beverages and treats :)\n\\*Live Music (Band and DJ) with dancing at 
 our second secret location\n\n\\*Dress casual or dress up if you like :)\n
 \n-Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fun night
  out.\n\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum at the first and second loca
 tion upon arrival. Thank you for your understanding and co-operation.\n\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer)\nme
 etup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nEvent Details:
 \n**The Friday Night Ultimate Pub Crawl (Live Band\, DJ and Dancing) (Ladi
 es Night!)**\n\n-We will meet ***on main floor\;*** connect with everyone\
 , ice breaker game\, socialize\, share some laughs\; then make our way to 
 our surprise location with live music\, cool atmosphere\, great people and
  dancing :)\n\\*Plan to come for dinner too if you like at the first venue
 \, as tables will be reserved for everyone\n\\*Invite your friends out too
 \n\n(2nd venue will be very close- walking distance for us)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\n**EVENT FEE:**\n\n**Night of Event- Friday July 10th (Arrival Times)**
 \nLadies Fee:\n-5 dollars from (8:00-9:30 pm)\n-10 dollars (9:31-10:00)\nG
 entlemen Fee:\n-10 dollars if you arrive between (8:00 pm to 9:30 pm)\n-15
  dollars if you arrive between (9:31 pm to 10:00 pm)\n\nIf you arrive afte
 r that you will simply miss the event as we will be heading off to the nex
 t venue at that time :)\n**\\*cash at the door**\n**or by e transfer in ad
 vance to:**\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Parking Available:**\n\n\\*Plen
 ty of free street parking on Eglinton and (Residential area south/east of 
 venue for free)\n**Close to Subway Station:**\n\\*Also three minute walk e
 ast from Yonge/Eglinton subway station
